  recording: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 41f1e870c779bcc48b94530b9ec3a4a1, type: 3}
  subtitles:
  - text: "Okay... this is weird. I\u2019m in the Kitchen. The pizza is great, but...
      do you hear that?"
    duration: 9.5
  - text: It sounds like... scratching. Inside the walls.
    duration: 5.5
  - text: I thought it was rats at first. But rats don't sound that... heavy.
    duration: 6.5
  - text: "It\u2019s probably just the pipes. Old buildings make noises, right?"
    duration: 5
  - text: Anyway, I drank too much soda. Gonna head to the Restrooms.
    duration: 4.5
  - text: If you find this tape next to the oven, check the <b><color=yellow>men's
      room</color></b> next.
    duration: 4.5
